@startuml st-support-request
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6

title State Machine Diagram — SupportRequest Entity (6 States)

[*] --> NEW : Customer files support ticket on portal\n/ SupportService#createTicket (BR-SUP-01)

NEW --> ASSIGNED : FM assigns ticket to on-duty Facility Staff\n/ SupportService#assignTicket (BR-SUP-02)
NEW --> IN_PROGRESS : Staff directly picks up ticket from facility queue\n/ SupportService#startTicket

ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : Assigned staff begins investigation/repair\n/ SupportService#startTicket (BR-SUP-02)

IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED : Staff completes inspection/repair/PIN re-issue\n[Resolution details & evidence logged]\n/ SupportService#resolveTicket (BR-SUP-03, BR-SUP-04)
IN_PROGRESS --> ASSIGNED : Staff transfers ticket to another specialist staff\n/ SupportService#reassignTicket

RESOLVED --> CLOSED : Customer accepts resolution & submits rating (1-5 stars)\n/ SupportService#closeTicket
RESOLVED --> AUTO_CLOSED : 72 hours pass without customer feedback\n/ SupportAutoCloseScheduler (BR-SUP-05)
RESOLVED --> IN_PROGRESS : Customer reports issue unresolved (reopens ticket)\n/ SupportService#reopenTicket

CLOSED --> [*]
AUTO_CLOSED --> [*]
@enduml

